      "sourceText": "| 方向 | 话题 | 本节点怎样使用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 订阅 | `lidar_odometry` | 取最近收到的位置作为距离与高度的基准；预期是 `odom` 中的雷达位姿 |\n| 订阅 | `registered_scan` | 输入 `odom` 中的配准点云，用于累计、选地面和计算远场高差 |\n| 订阅 | `terrain_map` | 保存近场节点最近一帧结果，取其中4 m内的点直接合入输出 |\n| 订阅 | `joy`、`cloud_clearing` | 触发自身缓存清图；后者还提供清图半径 |\n| 发布 | `terrain_map_ext` | 合并结果，参考系写死为 `odom`，时间标为当前输入扫描时间；自身远场的 `intensity` 是绝对高度差，单位 m |",
      "translatedText": "| Direction | Topic | How this node uses it |\n|---|---|---|\n| Subscribe | `lidar_odometry` | Use the latest received position as the distance and height reference, expected to be `odom` ’s LiDAR pose |\n| Subscribe | `registered_scan` | Input a registered point cloud in `odom` for accumulation, ground selection and far\\-field height differences |\n| Subscribe | `terrain_map` | Save the near\\-field node’s latest frame and directly merge its points within 4 m into the output |\n| Subscribe | `joy`、`cloud_clearing` | Trigger clearing of this node’s own cache; the latter also supplies the clearing radius |\n| Publish | `terrain_map_ext` | Merged result, with reference frame hardcoded to `odom` and timestamped with the current input scan time\\. The node’s own far\\-field `intensity` represents absolute height difference in m |",
      "provider": "manual",
      "model": "codex-semantic-review",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 0,
        "outputTokens": 0,
        "costUsd": 0
      }
    },
